msgstr "Els millors hoplites eren escollits per formar un grup de soldats professionals d’elit."

#: simulation/data/civs/athen.json
msgid "Elite Hoplites can promote to Champion Spearmen."
msgstr "Els hoplites d’elit poden ascendir a llancers campions."

