#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Trademasters"
msgstr "Mestres comerciants"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid ""
"The Carthaginians were broadly known for their extensive trade over the "
"Mediterranean Sea."
msgstr "Els cartaginesos eren àmpliament coneguts pel seu comerç extens per la mar Mediterrània."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Trade ships are available in the Village Phase."
msgstr "Els vaixells comercials estan disponibles en la fase inicial."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Mining Economy"
msgstr "Economia de mines"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid ""
"The Carthaginian economy was centered around mining, with stone comprising "
"much of Carthage's structures."
msgstr "L’economia cartaginesa se centrava en la mineria, i la pedra formava bona part de les construccions de Cartago."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Stone mining technologies are free and instant."
msgstr "Les tecnologies de mineria de pedra són gratuïtes i immediates."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Numidian Cavalry"
msgstr "Cavalleria númida"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid ""
"The Numidian cavalry's horses, ancestors of the Berber horse, were small "
"compared with other horses of the era, and were well adapted for faster "
"movement over long distances."
msgstr "Els cavalls de la cavalleria númida, avantpassats del cavall berber, eren petits en comparació amb els d’altres pobles de l’època i estaven ben adaptats per a desplaçar-se ràpidament a llargues distàncies."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Cavalry Javelineers +10% walk speed."
msgstr "La cavalleria amb javelina es mou un 10% més ràpid."

